# Nullable unshift arguments are rejected

Verifies unshift cannot store a potentially null value in an array with a
non-nullable element contract.

>>> source
let item: int? = 10
let values: int[] = []
values->unshift(item)

<<< stdout

<<< stderr
eck: nullable value must be narrowed before this operation at Span { start: 59, end: 63 }

<<< exit
1
